@@ -2941,6 +2941,16 @@ Property list
     ``video-params/chroma-location``
         Chroma location as string. (Exact values subject to change.)
 
+    ``video-params/dolby-vision-el``
+        What the current frame's Dolby Vision RPU says of an enhancement
+        layer: ``mel`` (minimal: its residual changes nothing, so the base
+        layer with the RPU is the whole picture) or ``fel`` (full: the
+        picture needs the enhancement layer). Decided as libdovi's
+        ``is_mel()``. Unavailable without an RPU or for an RPU without a
+        residual (profiles 5, 8 and 10). Most useful as
+        ``video-dec-params/dolby-vision-el``, before filters such as
+        ``format:dolbyvision=no``.
+
     ``video-params/rotate``
         Intended display rotation in degrees (clockwise).
 
